{"YOU|0|If anything walks into that, I'll hear it.":["intro",0,16797,2760],"YOU|0|Wristbands. All of them. Meridian.":["story",0,14637,2400],"RHEA|1|Same as yours.":["story",14637,7725,1248],"YOU|0|Ten thousand people, Rhea.":["story",22362,11325,1848],"RHEA|1|Not all of them are out here. Some went missing. Some were transferred.":["story",33687,23421,3864],"YOU|0|Transferred where?":["story",57108,9021,1464],"RHEA|1|That was the word they used. I never asked.":["story",66129,15501,2544],"YOU|0|You never asked.":["story",81630,9309,1512],"RHEA|1|I know how that sounds.":["story",90939,9309,1512],"RHEA|1|Okafor said stay away from the towers. They're also the only thing that can carry a signal. So. Something stupid.":["story",100248,41853,6936],"YOU|0|Light the towers.":["story",142101,9309,1512],"RHEA|1|Light the towers.":["story",151410,7869,1272],"HOLLOW|0|Fall. Forget. Belong.":["story",159279,16797,2760],"HOLLOW|0|Ten thousand and one! The one has come home!":["story",176076,23133,3816],"YOU|0|Someone's following me. It's me. A few seconds behind.":["late",0,23277,3840],"RHEA|1|Don't look at it too long.":["late",23277,9021,1464],"RHEA|1|The signal's so strong here I can hear my own heartbeat in it.":["late",32298,20973,3456],"YOU|0|Rhea, the rocks are floating.":["late",53271,12045,1968],"RHEA|1|Of course they are. Why wouldn't they be.":["late",65316,13629,2232],"HOLLOW|0|The one walks north! Stop the one!":["late",78945,19389,3192],"RHEA|1|{name}, there's a light ahead of you. White. My whole screen's just white.":["late",98334,24861,4104],"YOU|0|I'm walking into it.":["late",123195,9309,1512],"RHEA|1|I know. I think I've always known you would.":["late",132504,14781,2424],"YOU|0|Rhea. Did you know?":["intro",16797,9309,1512],"RHEA|1|Not all of it.":["intro",26106,7005,1128],"YOU|0|How much of it?":["intro",33111,9021,1464],"RHEA|1|Later. I swear, later.":["intro",42132,10029,1632],"RHEA|1|Go back to the ambulance. There's a medkit in the side locker, and I want you near something with walls.":["intro",52161,34221,5664],"YOU|0|Black box. It's still got power. There's a recording.":["intro",86382,21261,3504],"PILOT|1|This is Captain Daniel Okafor. Final log. If you're hearing this, we didn't make it.":["intro",107643,35805,5928],"PILOT|1|Meridian lied to us. That light opened the second our patient's heart rate spiked.":["intro",143448,34509,5712],"PILOT|1|Reyes is gone. I looked away for one second and his seat was empty.":["intro",177957,28893,4776],"PILOT|1|Vance is in the back with the patient. If anyone finds this, keep them away from the towers. Please.":["intro",206850,41853,6936],"RHEA|1|{name}. About Ines.":["late",147285,9885,1608],"YOU|0|She said you dropped her off.":["late",157170,11757,1920],"RHEA|1|I've flown forty transfers. I talked every one of them down. I told myself they were going somewhere better.":["late",168927,37677,6240],"YOU|0|Were they?":["late",206604,6861,1104],"RHEA|1|I never asked. That was the job. Not asking.":["late",213465,17085,2808],"YOU|0|I'm keeping it. If it's a key, I want to know what it opens.":["late",230550,22701,3744],"TEO|0|Everyone says that.":["late",253251,12045,1968],"INES|0|Not everyone gets to be right.":["late",265296,12333,2016],"YOU|0|{name}. Not ten thousand and one. Just {name}.":["late",277629,22557,3720],"TEO|0|Then the fire's yours, whenever you want it.":["late",300186,20829,3432],"INES|0|You're still going north.":["late",321015,10029,1632],"YOU|0|I'm still going north.":["late",331044,11037,1800],"CHOIR|0|Ten thousand and one. Again.":["late",342081,28749,4752],"CHOIR|0|{name}. Again.":["late",370830,15789,2592],"YOU|0|Stones. Kindling. Dry wood.":["late",386619,13197,2160],"YOU|0|Right next to where I woke up.":["late",399816,12765,2088],"CHOIR|0|Ten thousand and one.":["late",412581,22989,3792],"CHOIR|0|{name}. You came with a name. You are the first who did.":["late",435570,32925,5448],"CHOIR|0|Meridian opened the door ten thousand times. The ten thousand and first time, the door opened itself.":["late",468495,73101,12144],"YOU|0|Why?":["late",541596,5565,888],"CHOIR|0|Because you were already on this side.":["late",547161,24861,4104],"YOU|0|Who are you?":["late",572022,8301,1344],"CHOIR|0|The ones who didn't forget. Every one of us walked in here. Every one of us was you.":["late",580323,57261,9504],"YOU|0|Then what happens now?":["late",637584,10029,1632],"CHOIR|0|Someone has to be waiting when you fall. Someone has to build the fire. Someone has to write it down.":["late",647613,69069,11472],"YOU|0|Ten thousand and one. Active. Flight, the fourteenth of March.":["late",716682,26589,4392],"YOU|0|It was my handwriting. The whole time.":["late",743271,16797,2760],"RHEA|1|{name}? I can't see you anymore. Everything's gone white.":["late",760068,19533,3216],"YOU|0|Rhea. You told me nobody was going anywhere tonight.":["late",779601,21549,3552],"RHEA|1|When did I say that?":["late",801150,8733,1416],"YOU|0|You will.":["late",809883,6573,1056],"RHEA|1|Then come back to me.":["late",816456,8733,1416],"YOU|0|Every time.":["late",825189,8157,1320],"PILOT|1|Meridian Control, Medevac Two Six. Level three one zero. Cargo's asleep. Crew's awake. Mostly.":["intro",248703,46029,7632],"DEZ|0|Mostly?":["intro",294732,5421,864],"PILOT|0|You've checked that fuel gauge nine times, Reyes.":["intro",300153,21405,3528],"DEZ|0|It's my first black-site run, Captain. I'm allowed nine.":["intro",321558,19533,3216],"PILOT|0|It's a hospital transfer.":["intro",341091,12333,2016],"DEZ|0|Hospitals don't pay triple. And they don't make you sign an NDA in the parking lot.":["intro",353424,30621,5064],"PILOT|0|Fair.":["intro",384045,6285,1008],"RHEA|1|Cabin to cockpit. Are you two done gossiping? My patient's trying to sleep.":["intro",390330,26589,4392],"PILOT|1|Your patient's sedated, Vance.":["intro",416919,14925,2448],"RHEA|0|Mm. Then explain why their heart rate just jumped to one forty.":["intro",431844,23421,3864],"DEZ|0|Is that bad? That sounds bad.":["intro",455265,10749,1752],"RHEA|1|In someone this sedated? It means they're having one hell of a dream.":["intro",466014,23997,3960],"RHEA|0|Hey, sleeper. It's Rhea again. Whatever you're dreaming about, you can let it go.":["intro",490011,26013,4296],"RHEA|0|I've got you. Nobody's going anywhere tonight.":["intro",516024,16941,2784],"DEZ|0|Captain. Twelve o'clock. Is that a storm?":["intro",532965,13629,2232],"PILOT|0|Storms don't glow like that.":["intro",546594,13629,2232],"DEZ|0|It's opening. Why is it opening?":["intro",560223,11037,1800],"PILOT|0|Autopilot off. Hard left, now.":["intro",571260,17373,2856],"DEZ|0|She's not answering! Everything's dead, the controls are dead!":["intro",588633,19965,3288],"RHEA|0|Captain, talk to me!":["intro",608598,9309,1512],"PILOT|1|Vance, strap in. Strap the patient in!":["intro",617907,18381,3024],"RHEA|0|Already done. Sleeper, hold on to me. Hold on.":["intro",636288,19101,3144],"PILOT|0|Mayday, mayday, Medevac Two Six. We're going in. God help whoever's down there.":["intro",655389,34653,5736],"HOLLOW|0|Count it.":["intro",690042,8157,1320],"HOLLOW|0|Ten thousand.":["intro",698199,11181,1824],"HOLLOW|0|No. Count again.":["intro",709380,12621,2064],"HOLLOW|0|Ten thousand. And one.":["intro",722001,16797,2760],"YOU|0|They're going back into the trees.":["intro",738798,12333,2016],"RHEA|1|Sun's coming up. Or whatever that is. Come back to the fire.":["intro",751131,21117,3480],"RHEA|1|Sun's up. Or whatever that is. You made it, {name}.":["night",0,18381,3024],"RHEA|1|Dawn. I could hear you fighting from here. Rest.":["night",18381,16797,2760],"YOU|0|Still here.":["night",35178,7005,1128],"RHEA|1|Still here.":["night",42183,6141,984],"RHEA|1|That's another night. I'm marking them on my arm.":["night",48324,16797,2760],"RHEA|1|It's gone very quiet where you are.":["intro",772248,11757,1920],"YOU|0|It isn't quiet. Something keeps walking just past the light.":["intro",784005,23997,3960],"RHEA|1|Then don't leave the light.":["intro",808002,9309,1512],"RHEA|1|You're in the dark part of the woods. Your signal's going.":["intro",817311,18093,2976],"YOU|0|There's something out here worth finding.":["intro",835404,14061,2304],"RHEA|1|There's always something out there. Be quick.":["intro",849465,14781,2424],"ECHO|0|Patient seven. Day one. They said it was a clinical trial. They said I'd be home by spring.":["echo",0,32781,5424],"ECHO|0|Four twelve. The shards sing when you're close to the towers. Don't sing back.":["echo",32781,25725,4248],"ECHO|0|Eleven twenty three. I forgot my daughter's name today. I wrote it on my arm. Now I can't read my own handwriting.":["echo",58506,43581,7224],"ECHO|0|Twenty thirty one. The masks aren't for war. They're so we don't have to see who we used to be.":["echo",102087,33213,5496],"ECHO|0|Thirty three forty four. Meridian sends one of us through every few days. Like feeding something.":["echo",135300,32781,5424],"ECHO|0|Forty three eighty two. They'll list me as missing. I'm not missing. The Warden was kind once. He taught me how to make fire.":["echo",168081,44445,7368],"ECHO|0|Fifty sixty three. There's a voice on the radio every time one of us falls. Warm. Funny. Calls herself Rhea.":["echo",212526,37965,6288],"ECHO|0|Sixty seventy one. Fall. Forget. Belong. It isn't a prayer. It's a set of instructions.":["echo",250491,30909,5112],"ECHO|0|Seventy two ninety one. Transferred, they'll say. The second moon is closer every night. I measured it with my thumb.":["echo",281400,46029,7632],"ECHO|0|Ninety eight forty three. If you're the last one, listen. The door doesn't lead home. Home is what it eats.":["echo",327429,33501,5544],"ECHO|0|Ten thousand. There was a fire pit by the wreck when I landed. Already built. Like somebody knew. I kept it lit. Whoever you are, keep it lit.":["echo",360930,50637,8400],"YOU|0|Ten thousand and one. {name}. If you're hearing this, it's already happened. I've done this before. Many times.":["echo",411567,40269,6672],"YOU|0|I built the fire. I carried the case to it. I wrote us into the book, so you'd know you were expected.":["echo",451836,39405,6528],"YOU|0|Stop counting the nights. Start counting the people. Find Rhea.":["echo",491241,25437,4200],"RHEA|1|{name}? Who were you talking to?":["echo",516678,11757,1920],"YOU|0|Me.":["echo",528435,5565,888],"RHEA|1|{name}? Your signal just doubled. Like there are two of you standing there.":["echo",534000,24717,4080],"RHEA|1|Hey, sleeper. It's Rhea again. Whatever you're dreaming about, you can let it go.":["late",833346,25725,4248],"RHEA|1|I've got you. Nobody's going anywhere tonight.":["late",859071,16797,2760],"YOU|0|I know.":["late",875868,8301,1344],"RHEA|1|Sleeper?":["late",884169,6141,984],"RHEA|1|{name}, the signal's through! But it's not going home. Something on the other side is pulling it.":["story",199209,31341,5184],"CHOIR|0|Ten thousand and one. We counted every fall. You are the one we did not count.":["story",230550,60861,10104],"CHOIR|0|Come and see.":["story",291411,16077,2640],"RHEA|1|Don't you dare go anywhere without me.":["story",307488,12189,1992],"YOU|0|Someone built a fire pit. Stones, kindling, dry wood. Right next to where I woke up.":["intro",864246,37533,6216],"RHEA|1|Then light it. Whatever's out there, I'd rather it saw you from far away than up close.":["intro",901779,28749,4752],"RHEA|1|Better. I can see your smoke from here.":["intro",930528,12765,2088],"YOU|0|There's a case by the stones. Meridian. Somebody carried it here from the wreck.":["intro",943293,29901,4944],"RHEA|1|Don't open that. {name}, those files aren't for":["intro",973194,17085,2808],"YOU|0|It's already open.":["intro",990279,9885,1608],"RHEA|1|The fire's dying! Get back to it!":["night",65121,13197,2160],"YOU|0|It's out. I need something that burns.":["intro",1000164,15933,2616],"TEO|0|Sit. The fire doesn't ask questions.":["late",890310,19821,3264],"TEO|0|Meridian thinks it's a door. It isn't. It's a mouth. And it's always hungry.":["late",910131,33645,5568],"INES|0|And sometimes it spits us back out. Changed. Alive. It's a door, Teo. Doors go both ways.":["late",943776,31341,5184],"TEO|0|Everyone who wants to go home walks north into the Basin. Nobody walks back.":["late",975117,32925,5448],"INES|0|Because nobody's tried it with a key.":["late",1008042,12909,2112],"RHEA|1|{name}, listen to me. Meridian has a pickup at the heart of the Basin. That's what the towers were for. I can get you out. I just need you there.":["late",1020951,51213,8496],"TEO|0|Your radio woman. Ask her what happens to the ones she picks up.":["late",1072164,28461,4704],"YOU|0|Rhea?":["late",1100625,5565,888],"RHEA|1|I don't know. I never asked.":["late",1106190,11181,1824],"TEO|0|Leave your band on the wall. Stay. Be a person here instead of a number out there.":["late",1117371,33789,5592],"INES|0|Or keep it, walk north, and find out what the number's for.":["late",1151160,18237,3000],"HOLLOW|0|Room four. Don't close it. Don't close the door.":["intro",1016097,23853,3936],"YOU|0|It's wearing a wristband. Twenty two ninety one.":["intro",1039950,20685,3408],"RHEA|1|That one says terminated.":["intro",1060635,10029,1632],"YOU|0|Then why was it walking?":["intro",1070664,10893,1776],"RHEA|1|You're back.":["intro",1081557,5853,936],"YOU|0|You knew I'd make it.":["intro",1087410,10317,1680],"RHEA|1|I knew where you'd come back from.":["intro",1097727,10317,1680],"YOU|0|It's warm. And it's humming.":["intro",1108044,11757,1920],"RHEA|1|My scanner just jumped off the chart. Not near me. Near you. Keep it. Keep all of them.":["intro",1119801,32637,5400],"YOU|0|Rhea. Someone's standing in the trees.":["intro",1152438,14493,2376],"RHEA|1|Say again?":["intro",1166931,6429,1032],"YOU|0|Nothing. They're gone.":["intro",1173360,9309,1512],"HOLLOW|0|Visiting hours are over.":["common",0,17373,2856],"HOLLOW|0|Is it Tuesday? It feels like Tuesday.":["common",17373,21549,3552],"HOLLOW|0|Take your medicine.":["common",38922,11613,1896],"HOLLOW|0|I had a name. I had a name!":["common",50535,18093,2976],"HOLLOW|0|Don't look at the moons.":["common",68628,13773,2256],"HOLLOW|0|Count it! Ten thousand!":["common",82401,16509,2712],"HOLLOW|0|Lights out. Lights out!":["common",98910,15069,2472],"HOLLOW|0|Nurse? Nurse!":["common",113979,10893,1776],"HOLLOW|0|Room four. Room four.":["common",124872,17229,2832],"HOLLOW|0|Mom?":["common",142101,7293,1176],"HOLLOW|0|Don't close it!":["common",149394,10173,1656],"HOLLOW|0|And one. And one.":["common",159567,14349,2352],"INES|0|Don't swing. I'm not one of them.":["late",1169397,11325,1848],"YOU|0|You've got a wristband.":["late",1180722,9885,1608],"INES|0|Forty three eighty two. They wrote me down as missing. I wasn't missing. I was busy.":["late",1190607,26877,4440],"INES|0|You put the Warden down. Do you know what that means?":["late",1217484,16509,2712],"YOU|0|That he stops trying to kill me?":["late",1233993,12765,2088],"INES|0|It means nobody's standing in the door. Everything out here is going to come and look.":["late",1246758,27741,4584],"RHEA|1|{name}, I've got two signals on you. One of them's wrong. It's too bright.":["late",1274499,25149,4152],"INES|0|Tell her Ines says hello. She'll remember me. She's the one who dropped me off.":["late",1299648,24717,4080],"RHEA|1|Ines?":["late",1324365,5853,936],"INES|0|There are people in the deep woods. Living ones. Keep the red light on your right and walk until the trees go black. I'll have the fire going.":["late",1330218,45453,7536],"YOU|0|Rhea. I died. I felt it.":["night",78318,12765,2088],"RHEA|1|What? You're right here, {name}. You never left the fire.":["night",91083,18381,3024],"YOU|0|Then why do I remember the dark?":["night",109464,13773,2256],"YOU|0|Same moons. Same smoke. Same fire.":["night",123237,17661,2904],"RHEA|1|{name}, you're scaring me.":["night",140898,10173,1656],"YOU|0|Good. Stay scared. It keeps you alive.":["night",151071,15789,2592],"RHEA|1|Sleeper? Tap the radio if you can hear me. Anything.":["night",166860,18813,3096],"YOU|0|I know. I always know what you're going to say.":["night",185673,17949,2952],"RHEA|1|Then tell me how tonight ends.":["night",203622,10461,1704],"YOU|0|Differently.":["night",214083,7005,1128],"YOU|0|Again. The shards remember. So do I.":["night",221088,17085,2808],"YOU|0|Somebody's cut a mark into this tree.":["intro",1182669,15069,2472],"YOU|0|It's fresh.":["intro",1197738,7005,1128],"YOU|0|Wristbands on the stones by the fire. Mine. More of them every time.":["night",238173,30333,5016],"YOU|0|That cairn wasn't here last time.":["night",268506,13917,2280],"RHEA|1|Last time?":["night",282423,6861,1104],"YOU|0|Never mind.":["night",289284,7869,1272],"RHEA|1|{name}, the mast light's out. I can't find you without it.":["night",297153,20397,3360],"YOU|0|Then I'll find you.":["night",317550,9165,1488],"YOU|0|There's a page by the fire. The registry. My line.":["night",326715,21693,3576],"RHEA|1|Is the ink":["night",348408,7005,1128],"YOU|0|Still wet.":["night",355413,7149,1152],"YOU|0|Someone at the edge of the light again.":["night",362562,13917,2280],"RHEA|1|Same one?":["night",376479,6285,1008],"YOU|0|I think it's always the same one.":["night",382764,13197,2160],"RHEA|1|They've stopped at the edge of the light. Why have they stopped?":["night",395961,18381,3024],"YOU|0|They're waiting to see if I remember.":["night",414342,14781,2424],"CHOIR|0|Again.":["night",429123,14781,2424],"YOU|0|That tree was standing yesterday. Or whenever yesterday was.":["night",443904,24429,4032],"YOU|0|I understand it now. It isn't punishing me. It's waiting for me to build the fire.":["night",468333,33501,5544],"RHEA|1|Then build it. I'll be on the radio. I'm always on the radio.":["night",501834,22269,3672],"RHEA|0|Sleeper? Over here.":["night",524103,11757,1920],"RHEA|1|{name}, that wasn't me. I didn't say anything. I swear I didn't say anything.":["night",535860,27453,4536],"RHEA|1|The wreck's ahead of you. Follow the smoke.":["common",173916,13917,2280],"RHEA|1|Head back to the ambulance. Keep the dead tree behind you.":["common",187833,20973,3456],"RHEA|1|The fire pit's by the ambulance. Look for the stones.":["common",208806,19101,3144],"RHEA|1|The case. It's by the stones, where the fire is.":["common",227907,16797,2760],"RHEA|1|Follow the smoke back. The fire's by the ambulance.":["common",244704,19245,3168],"RHEA|1|Listen for the towers. One's west, past that blue scar. One's east, out by the dead tree. One's north.":["common",263949,38253,6336],"RHEA|1|Follow the beams north. To the stones.":["common",302202,14637,2400],"RHEA|1|East. Where the trees go black.":["common",316839,11757,1920],"RHEA|1|North. Toward the white light.":["common",328596,10749,1752],"RHEA|1|That one won't be the last.":["intro",1204743,9741,1584],"RHEA|1|There's weather coming. I can hear it on the radio, rolling in from the north.":["intro",1214484,26301,4344],"YOU|0|How long?":["intro",1240785,7149,1152],"RHEA|1|Long enough to find things that burn. Food. Water. Go.":["intro",1247934,22413,3696],"YOU|0|You always say that.":["intro",1270347,9597,1560],"RHEA|1|Do I?":["intro",1279944,5997,960],"RHEA|1|{name}, the rift went wild when the Warden fell. It's spitting Hollow out of the sky, and I can't reach you before dark.":["night",563313,41565,6888],"RHEA|1|The fire pit by the ambulance. Somebody built it for you. Light it. Stay in the light.":["night",604878,30765,5088],"RHEA|1|First night out here. Keep the fire burning. Whatever comes out of the dark, it hates the light.":["night",635643,31917,5280],"RHEA|1|I found tracks by the river. Bare feet. Dozens of them. Heading your way.":["night",667560,26301,4344],"RHEA|1|I keep hearing my name in the static. In my own voice. That's normal, right?":["night",693861,26589,4392],"YOU|0|Totally normal.":["night",720450,8877,1440],"RHEA|1|You're a terrible liar.":["night",729327,9021,1464],"RHEA|1|The second moon looks bigger tonight. Tell me I'm wrong.":["night",738348,19101,3144],"YOU|0|You're wrong.":["night",757449,7149,1152],"RHEA|1|Liar.":["night",764598,5853,936],"RHEA|1|Something big is walking toward your fire. Something that used to be the Warden.":["night",770451,26445,4368],"RHEA|1|I tried to walk to you today. Six hours. I ended up right where I started.":["night",796896,26733,4416],"RHEA|1|If I stop answering, keep the fire lit anyway. Promise me.":["night",823629,22557,3720],"YOU|0|Promise.":["night",846186,6573,1056],"RHEA|1|The Hollow are learning. They watched you fight last night.":["night",852759,18237,3000],"CHOIR|0|Ten thousand and one. Stop counting the nights. We stopped long ago.":["night",870996,55245,9168],"YOU|0|Their fire's lit.":["intro",1285941,8877,1440],"RHEA|1|Is that another survivor?":["intro",1294818,9597,1560],"YOU|0|There's nobody here.":["intro",1304415,9453,1536],"YOU|0|That's my pack.":["intro",1313868,8589,1392],"YOU|0|I don't remember putting it down.":["intro",1322457,12621,2064],"RHEA|1|It worked, the signal jumped! And there's something riding underneath it. Voices.":["story",319677,26589,4392],"YOU|0|Tell me you heard that.":["story",346266,9885,1608],"RHEA|1|I heard it. I really wish I hadn't. Keep going.":["story",356151,16941,2784],"YOU|0|Rhea, are you there?":["story",373092,9309,1512],"RHEA|1|...I'm here.":["story",382401,6141,984],"YOU|0|Where?":["story",388542,5709,912],"RHEA|1|{name}, I need to tell you something before I lose my nerve.":["story",394251,20541,3384],"YOU|0|That's never a good start.":["story",414792,11325,1848],"RHEA|1|My orders weren't to keep you alive. They were to keep you asleep. Until we landed.":["story",426117,26445,4368],"YOU|0|Landed where?":["story",452562,8301,1344],"RHEA|1|I think they meant here.":["story",460863,9021,1464],"WARDEN|0|Who rings my towers?":["story",469884,14493,2376],"RHEA|1|All three beams point north. To that stone circle.":["story",484377,18381,3024],"YOU|0|Something's waiting there.":["story",502758,9885,1608],"RHEA|1|Something's been waiting there a very long time.":["story",512643,15213,2496],"HOLLOW|0|No! No, the towers wake him!":["story",527856,19245,3168],"RHEA|1|You're breaking up. Your radio's dying.":["intro",1335078,14205,2328],"YOU|0|Then I'll find it something to eat.":["intro",1349283,13629,2232],"RHEA|1|How far are you?":["intro",1362912,7869,1272],"YOU|0|I don't know.":["intro",1370781,8157,1320],"RHEA|1|Then you're farther than you should be.":["intro",1378938,11325,1848],"RHEA|1|Is the fire still going?":["intro",1390263,9741,1584],"YOU|0|For now.":["intro",1400004,7293,1176],"RHEA|1|Make it longer than for now.":["intro",1407297,9885,1608],"RHEA|1|What have you got?":["intro",1417182,7293,1176],"YOU|0|Tins. Water. Somebody's socks.":["intro",1424475,14061,2304],"RHEA|1|Keep the tins.":["intro",1438536,7149,1152],"YOU|0|A Meridian crate. Somebody dropped this out here on purpose.":["intro",1445685,25149,4152],"YOU|0|Rhea. There's a record for me.":["intro",1470834,11613,1896],"RHEA|1|That's not possible. They don't assign a number until":["intro",1482447,17661,2904],"YOU|0|Ten thousand and one. Active. Dated three days before we took off.":["intro",1500108,29613,4896],"RHEA|1|I'm here. I signed off on ten thousand myself. There was no one after.":["intro",1529721,26301,4344],"YOU|0|Then who wrote me in?":["intro",1556022,9165,1488],"RHEA|1|It's handwritten. Isn't it.":["intro",1565187,10605,1728],"YOU|0|How did you know that?":["intro",1575792,9741,1584],"RHEA|1|Stay by the fire. Please. Just stay by the fire.":["intro",1585533,18525,3048],"RHEA|1|{name}! Get up. Don't you dare quit on me.":["common",339345,15501,2544],"RHEA|1|Breathe. In. Out. You're not done, and I'm not done with you.":["common",354846,19389,3192],"RHEA|1|Up! You can bleed later. That's a medical opinion.":["common",374235,18237,3000],"YOU|0|Rhea.":["intro",1604058,5565,888],"RHEA|1|What? What's wrong?":["intro",1609623,7725,1248],"YOU|0|Look up.":["intro",1617348,6573,1056],"RHEA|1|Okay. That's two moons.":["intro",1623921,10173,1656],"YOU|0|Two moons.":["intro",1634094,7149,1152],"RHEA|1|I counted. Three times. Still two.":["intro",1641243,15069,2472],"RHEA|1|Panic later. The black box has its own battery. If it's still sending, someone might hear. Get to the wreck.":["intro",1656312,36669,6072],"TEO|0|Another one walking in on their own feet. That's twice this year.":["late",1375671,27453,4536],"INES|0|Teo, this is ten thousand and one.":["late",1403124,13341,2184],"TEO|0|No. There's no such number.":["late",1416465,16509,2712],"YOU|0|That's what everyone keeps telling me.":["late",1432974,14637,2400],"RHEA|1|{name}, is that you breathing like that?":["intro",1692981,13917,2280],"YOU|0|Like what?":["intro",1706898,7149,1152],"RHEA|1|Nothing. It's the static. Must be the static.":["intro",1714047,16509,2712],"YOU|0|Something scratched the side of the ambulance.":["intro",1730556,16221,2664],"RHEA|1|Scratched, or wrote?":["intro",1746777,8301,1344],"YOU|0|Tally marks. Hundreds of them.":["intro",1755078,14637,2400],"YOU|0|And one word under all of them. Hundred.":["intro",1769715,18237,3000],"RHEA|1|Keep moving.":["intro",1787952,7005,1128],"YOU|0|Rhea. There's someone standing by the wreck.":["intro",1794957,15213,2496],"RHEA|1|A survivor? Wave at them.":["intro",1810170,11181,1824],"YOU|0|They're gone.":["intro",1821351,7437,1200],"YOU|0|Footprints. Bare feet.":["intro",1828788,10461,1704],"RHEA|1|Ours?":["intro",1839249,5853,936],"YOU|0|Nobody on that plane walked out barefoot.":["intro",1845102,15933,2616],"YOU|0|They go around the ambulance. All the way around. Like someone was checking on me.":["intro",1861035,31773,5256],"HOLLOW|0|Nurse?":["intro",1892808,7149,1152],"RHEA|1|Here it comes. Stay by the fire, {name}. Whatever you hear out there, it isn't":["intro",1899957,27165,4488],"RHEA|1|The storm's coming in again. It only ever starts when you wake up.":["intro",1927122,22413,3696],"YOU|0|When I wake up?":["intro",1949535,8877,1440],"RHEA|1|That isn't what I meant.":["intro",1958412,9165,1488],"YOU|0|I need more than what's lying around. Fuel. Medicine.":["intro",1967577,23565,3888],"RHEA|1|There's a light on the path toward the old camp. A lantern. It isn't mine.":["intro",1991142,25437,4200],"YOU|0|Somebody else is out here?":["intro",2016579,12045,1968],"YOU|0|Meridian surplus. Somebody's chalked prices on the lids.":["intro",2028624,24429,4032],"YOU|0|Fire axe. Okay. Okay, I can do fire axe.":["intro",2053053,21837,3600],"RHEA|1|Good. Now the doors. Kick them like they owe you money.":["intro",2074890,18237,3000],"YOU|0|Rhea. Something's watching me. It's not one of them.":["common",392472,20541,3384],"RHEA|1|Not a Hollow?":["common",413013,7005,1128],"YOU|0|No mask. No wristband. No face, really.":["common",420018,19965,3288],"RHEA|1|Then it was here before any of us. Back away slow. Find a fire if you can.":["common",439983,26589,4392],"TRADER|0|Watch my hands. I'll only do it once.":["intro",2093127,17517,2880],"TRADER|0|Fair.":["intro",2110644,7149,1152],"TRADER|0|That'll keep you a while.":["intro",2117793,12765,2088],"TRADER|0|Spend it before it spends you.":["intro",2130558,15069,2472],"YOU|0|There's someone at that table.":["intro",2145627,11325,1848],"TRADER|0|Sit if you want. Pay for what you touch.":["intro",2156952,16797,2760],"YOU|0|Pay with what?":["intro",2173749,7437,1200],"TRADER|0|Shards. Same as everyone.":["intro",2181186,13773,2256],"RHEA|1|Who's that with you?":["intro",2194959,7725,1248],"YOU|0|Somebody selling medkits.":["intro",2202684,11325,1848],"RHEA|1|Then buy one.":["intro",2214009,7149,1152],"RHEA|1|Sleeper? Oh, thank God. Tap the radio if you can hear me. Anything.":["intro",2221158,24717,4080],"YOU|0|I'm here. I think. Where's here?":["intro",2245875,12909,2112],"RHEA|1|{name}. That's what your wristband says. Hi, {name}. I'm Rhea. I've been talking to you for six hours and you never once talked back.":["intro",2258784,39405,6528],"YOU|0|Sorry. I was unconscious.":["intro",2298189,12333,2016],"RHEA|1|Excuses. And stop picking at the wristband. You always pick at it.":["intro",2310522,23997,3960],"YOU|0|Always?":["intro",2334519,7437,1200],"RHEA|1|You picked at it the whole flight. Listen. I got thrown clear. My leg's fine. ...It's not fine. I'm moving.":["intro",2341956,39981,6624],"RHEA|1|That smell is fuel. Find something heavy and get out of that box before it decides to become a fireball.":["intro",2381937,36525,6048],"WARDEN|0|Patient One. Discharged.":["story",547101,16509,2712],"WARDEN|0|You think the sky saved you? The sky ate you!":["story",563610,23133,3816],"WARDEN|0|Ten thousand.":["story",586743,10461,1704],"WARDEN|0|No.":["story",597204,7293,1176],"WARDEN|0|Ten thousand. And one?":["story",604497,14925,2448],"WARDEN|0|You're not the one I was expecting.":["story",619422,17229,2832],"YOU|0|Who were you expecting?":["story",636651,10461,1704],"WARDEN|0|The last one. They promised me the last one. I was the first. I have counted every one of them down.":["story",647112,45021,7464],"WARDEN|0|There is no one after the last. So what are you?":["story",692133,23997,3960],"RHEA|1|{name}, the red ring! When it glows, jump or run!":["story",716130,19245,3168],"WARDEN|0|I remember rain. Real rain. Cold, on my face.":["story",735375,29469,4872],"WARDEN|0|Children! Hold the one I didn't count!":["story",764844,17373,2856],"HOLLOW|0|And one.":["intro",2418462,8157,1320],"YOU|0|Who's there?":["intro",2426619,7149,1152],"YOU|0|Wristbands. Hundreds of them, nailed up in rows.":["late",1447611,20253,3336],"INES|0|Everyone who makes it here leaves theirs. It's how we stop being numbers.":["late",1467864,24573,4056],"YOU|0|There's one here with my number on it.":["late",1492437,14205,2328],"INES|0|That's not possible.":["late",1506642,9309,1512],"YOU|0|The plastic's gone yellow. It's been here for years.":["late",1515951,20829,3432],"INES|0|Teo's going to want to see that.":["late",1536780,11613,1896],"WARDEN|0|I was the first. I will be the last thing you see. Again.":["night",926241,28605,4728],"RHEA|1|{name}! Stay down, breathe. I'm talking you back up.":["night",954846,18813,3096],"WARDEN|0|Patient One. Discharged. Again.":["night",973659,20109,3312],"RHEA|1|Here they come. Stay near the fire!":["night",993768,12477,2040],"RHEA|1|Rift's opening. Hold the light, {name}!":["night",1006245,14493,2376],"RHEA|1|I can hear them from here. Fire. Now.":["night",1020738,15069,2472],"YOU|0|They came from the wreck last time. They'll come from the wreck again.":["night",1035807,23565,3888],"YOU|0|They came from the Blackwood last time. They'll come from the Blackwood again.":["night",1059372,26589,4392],"YOU|0|They came from the mast last time. They'll come from the mast again.":["night",1085961,25725,4248],"YOU|0|They came from the field station last time. They'll come from the field station again.":["night",1111686,31917,5280],"YOU|0|They came from the stone circle last time. They'll come from the stone circle again.":["night",1143603,30765,5088],"YOU|0|If anything walks into that, I'll hear it.#b":["intro",2433768,14205,2328],"YOU|0|Wristbands. All of them. Meridian.#b":["story",782217,12765,2088],"YOU|0|Ten thousand people, Rhea.#b":["story",794982,10461,1704],"YOU|0|Transferred where?#b":["story",805443,7725,1248],"YOU|0|You never asked.#b":["story",813168,7581,1224],"YOU|0|Light the towers.#b":["story",820749,8013,1296],"YOU|0|Someone's following me. It's me. A few seconds behind.#b":["late",1548393,20829,3432],"YOU|0|Rhea, the rocks are floating.#b":["late",1569222,9741,1584],"YOU|0|I'm walking into it.#b":["late",1578963,8733,1416],"YOU|0|Rhea. Did you know?#b":["intro",2447973,7437,1200],"YOU|0|How much of it?#b":["intro",2455410,7437,1200],"YOU|0|Black box. It's still got power. There's a recording.#b":["intro",2462847,18525,3048],"YOU|0|She said you dropped her off.#b":["late",1587696,10317,1680],"YOU|0|Were they?#b":["late",1598013,5565,888],"YOU|0|I'm keeping it. If it's a key, I want to know what it opens.#b":["late",1603578,21117,3480],"YOU|0|{name}. Not ten thousand and one. Just {name}.#b":["late",1624695,20253,3336],"YOU|0|I'm still going north.#b":["late",1644948,9741,1584],"YOU|0|Stones. Kindling. Dry wood.#b":["late",1654689,12189,1992],"YOU|0|Right next to where I woke up.#b":["late",1666878,10029,1632],"YOU|0|Why?#b":["late",1676907,5133,816],"YOU|0|Who are you?#b":["late",1682040,6573,1056],"YOU|0|Then what happens now?#b":["late",1688613,8877,1440],"YOU|0|Ten thousand and one. Active. Flight, the fourteenth of March.#b":["late",1697490,24141,3984],"YOU|0|It was my handwriting. The whole time.#b":["late",1721631,14493,2376],"YOU|0|Rhea. You told me nobody was going anywhere tonight.#b":["late",1736124,18093,2976],"YOU|0|You will.#b":["late",1754217,5565,888],"YOU|0|Every time.#b":["late",1759782,6573,1056],"YOU|0|They're going back into the trees.#b":["intro",2481372,10749,1752],"YOU|0|Still here.#b":["night",1174368,6285,1008],"YOU|0|It isn't quiet. Something keeps walking just past the light.#b":["intro",2492121,21261,3504],"YOU|0|There's something out here worth finding.#b":["intro",2513382,12909,2112],"YOU|0|Ten thousand and one. {name}. If you're hearing this, it's already happened. I've done this before. Many times.#b":["echo",558717,35517,5880],"YOU|0|I built the fire. I carried the case to it. I wrote us into the book, so you'd know you were expected.#b":["echo",594234,35949,5952],"YOU|0|Stop counting the nights. Start counting the people. Find Rhea.#b":["echo",630183,23709,3912],"YOU|0|Me.#b":["echo",653892,4989,792],"YOU|0|I know.#b":["late",1766355,7005,1128],"YOU|0|Someone built a fire pit. Stones, kindling, dry wood. Right next to where I woke up.#b":["intro",2526291,32205,5328],"YOU|0|There's a case by the stones. Meridian. Somebody carried it here from the wreck.#b":["intro",2558496,27741,4584],"YOU|0|It's already open.#b":["intro",2586237,7869,1272],"YOU|0|It's out. I need something that burns.#b":["intro",2594106,13629,2232],"YOU|0|Rhea?#b":["late",1773360,4989,792],"YOU|0|It's wearing a wristband. Twenty two ninety one.#b":["intro",2607735,17373,2856],"YOU|0|Then why was it walking?#b":["intro",2625108,9309,1512],"YOU|0|You knew I'd make it.#b":["intro",2634417,8733,1416],"YOU|0|It's warm. And it's humming.#b":["intro",2643150,9885,1608],"YOU|0|Rhea. Someone's standing in the trees.#b":["intro",2653035,12765,2088],"YOU|0|Nothing. They're gone.#b":["intro",2665800,8589,1392],"YOU|0|You've got a wristband.#b":["late",1778349,8445,1368],"YOU|0|That he stops trying to kill me?#b":["late",1786794,10893,1776],"YOU|0|Rhea. I died. I felt it.#b":["night",1180653,10893,1776],"YOU|0|Then why do I remember the dark?#b":["night",1191546,11613,1896],"YOU|0|Same moons. Same smoke. Same fire.#b":["night",1203159,16365,2688],"YOU|0|Good. Stay scared. It keeps you alive.#b":["night",1219524,13773,2256],"YOU|0|I know. I always know what you're going to say.#b":["night",1233297,15069,2472],"YOU|0|Differently.#b":["night",1248366,6429,1032],"YOU|0|Again. The shards remember. So do I.#b":["night",1254795,14349,2352],"YOU|0|Somebody's cut a mark into this tree.#b":["intro",2674389,12765,2088],"YOU|0|It's fresh.#b":["intro",2687154,5997,960],"YOU|0|Wristbands on the stones by the fire. Mine. More of them every time.#b":["night",1269144,26733,4416],"YOU|0|That cairn wasn't here last time.#b":["night",1295877,11613,1896],"YOU|0|Never mind.#b":["night",1307490,6861,1104],"YOU|0|Then I'll find you.#b":["night",1314351,8013,1296],"YOU|0|There's a page by the fire. The registry. My line.#b":["night",1322364,19245,3168],"YOU|0|Still wet.#b":["night",1341609,6429,1032],"YOU|0|Someone at the edge of the light again.#b":["night",1348038,12909,2112],"YOU|0|I think it's always the same one.#b":["night",1360947,11469,1872],"YOU|0|They're waiting to see if I remember.#b":["night",1372416,12765,2088],"YOU|0|That tree was standing yesterday. Or whenever yesterday was.#b":["night",1385181,21981,3624],"YOU|0|I understand it now. 